  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1784946717_9906594_b2b3286707e167e588e739f92eff0eea.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div style=\"max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3a2a24;line-height:1.7;\"><div style=\"padding:52px 28px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);margin-bottom:24px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#ae6445;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\">ROCOXIA Affiliate Program</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:36px;line-height:1.25;color:#3a2a24;\">Build Stories. Share Creativity.<br>Earn with ROCOXIA.</h1><p style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#806f63;font-size:17px;\">Introduce your audience to imaginative DIY miniature worlds and earn commission by sharing products designed for book lovers, makers, and collectors.</p></div><div style=\"padding:30px;margin-bottom:18px;background:#fffaf5;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;padding:5px 12px;background:#ae6445;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">01</div><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#3a2a24;\">About Our Brand and Products</h2><p style=\"margin:0;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">ROCOXIA creates immersive DIY book nook kits, miniature houses, mechanical wooden models, and creative décor for book lovers, craft enthusiasts, and miniature collectors. Our kits transform ordinary shelves and living spaces into imaginative miniature worlds filled with architectural details, warm lighting, and engaging stories.</p><p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">Each project offers a relaxing hands-on experience and becomes a beautiful display piece or thoughtful gift once completed.</p></div><div style=\"padding:30px;margin-bottom:18px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;padding:5px 12px;background:#ae6445;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">02</div><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#3a2a24;\">What Makes Us Different</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">ROCOXIA combines creative storytelling, detailed craftsmanship, and interactive features to deliver a memorable experience from assembly to display.</p><div><span style=\"padding:8px 13px;background:#f7f0e8;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Immersive miniature scenes</span> <span style=\"padding:8px 13px;background:#f7f0e8;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Detailed craftsmanship</span> <span style=\"padding:8px 13px;background:#f7f0e8;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Interactive lighting</span> <span style=\"padding:8px 13px;background:#f7f0e8;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Relaxing DIY experience</span> <span style=\"padding:8px 13px;background:#f7f0e8;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Display-worthy designs</span></div><p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">Selected models feature touch-sensitive or motion-activated lighting, music boxes, moving gears, infinity-mirror effects, and protective dust covers. We also provide assembly guidance, responsive customer support, and replacement-part assistance when needed.</p></div><div style=\"padding:30px;margin-bottom:18px;background:#fffaf5;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;padding:5px 12px;background:#ae6445;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">03</div><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#3a2a24;\">How Affiliates Can Earn</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">Earn commission on eligible purchases generated through your unique affiliate link or discount code. Introduce products that match your audience and turn inspiring content into commissionable sales.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:22px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Share individual products and bestselling collections.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Introduce new arrivals and limited-time promotions.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Create seasonal gift guides and product recommendations.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Use your unique tracking link or affiliate discount code.</li><li>Earn from eligible orders placed by your referred customers.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;padding:13px 16px;background:#f4e8dd;border-left:3px solid #ae6445;color:#68483a;font-size:14px;\">Commission rates, attribution, and payment arrangements are subject to the terms displayed in your affiliate account.</p></div><div style=\"padding:30px;margin-bottom:18px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;padding:5px 12px;background:#ae6445;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">04</div><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#3a2a24;\">How to Promote Us</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">Promote ROCOXIA through the platforms and content formats that best fit your audience, including Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, Pinterest, blogs, and email newsletters.</p><div><div style=\"padding:18px;background:#f8f3ee;\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:16px;color:#3a2a24;\">Unboxing &amp; Reviews</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#806f63;font-size:14px;\">Introduce the kit, its features, materials, and finished appearance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:18px;background:#f8f3ee;\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:16px;color:#3a2a24;\">Assembly Content</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#806f63;font-size:14px;\">Create time-lapses, tutorials, building tips, or relaxing craft videos.</p></div><div style=\"padding:18px;background:#f8f3ee;\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:16px;color:#3a2a24;\">Finished Displays</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#806f63;font-size:14px;\">Show the completed model illuminated on a bookshelf or in a room.</p></div><div style=\"padding:18px;background:#f8f3ee;\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:16px;color:#3a2a24;\">Gift Guides</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#806f63;font-size:14px;\">Recommend ROCOXIA for book lovers, hobbyists, and miniature collectors.</p></div></div><p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">For stronger engagement, show both the assembly process and the illuminated finished model. Always include your unique affiliate link or discount code and clearly disclose your affiliate relationship.</p></div><div style=\"padding:30px;margin-bottom:24px;background:#fffaf5;border:1px solid rgba(174,100,69,0.22);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;padding:5px 12px;background:#ae6445;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">05</div><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#3a2a24;\">Other Information</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\">We welcome content creators, bloggers, publishers, book influencers, craft communities, miniature enthusiasts, and gift-focused partners who share our passion for creativity and imaginative design.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:22px;color:#5f5047;font-size:16px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Use accurate and up-to-date product information.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Do not make misleading claims or promote unauthorized discounts.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Spam and other deceptive promotional practices are prohibited.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Paid-search bidding on the ROCOXIA brand name requires prior written approval.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">ROCOXIA trademarks may not be used in domain names or social media account names without approval.</li><li>Product samples and special campaigns may be considered based on audience relevance, content quality, and previous performance.</li></ul></div><div style=\"padding:34px 24px;text-align:center;background:#3a2a24;color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:27px;color:#ffffff;\">Let’s Create Something Remarkable</h2><p style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;color:#eadfd6;font-size:16px;\">Join the ROCOXIA Affiliate Program and help more people discover the joy of building miniature worlds.</p></div></div></div>",
